xtstyle=\"\">第一指数可能先高位震荡</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\" textstyle=\"\">会有板块轮动的机会</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\" textstyle=\"\">比如今天的医药</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\" textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\" textstyle=\"\">第二一旦行情回调下来仍然是进场点</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\" textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\" textstyle=\"\">具体下方支撑在哪，先等它能回下来我们再详细分析</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\" textstyle=\"\">！</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:5.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\" textstyle=\"\">刘广义</span></span></font><font face=\"Calibri\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size